    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span>\n    <span class=\"time\">55 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Concurrency</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Asked at Uber, Walmart</span>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Thread Pools, Executors &amp; Futures</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Build a fixed thread pool from an empty file, learn the exact order in which <code>ThreadPoolExecutor</code> decides \"new thread, queue, or reject\", pick a rejection policy on purpose, and chain results with <code>Future</code> and <code>CompletableFuture</code>. That is enough to answer \"design a ThreadPoolExecutor\" in a Walmart or Uber LLD round.</p>\n"
